quote.p:
In accordance with the resolution of the GA of 19 April 1948 referring to the first committee for
                            consideration and report ‘further consideration of the question of the
                            future government of Palestine’;

That in view of the actual situation in Palestine the plan of partition
                            with economic union as set forth in its resolution No. 181 (11) of 29
                            November 1947 cannot be put into effect on 15 May 1948;

Taking particular note of the SC’s
                            resolution of 17 April 1948, which set forth the specific terms of a
                            truce for Palestine;
